OL,3,GNEWSASeven charged with online child   
OL,4,Asexual exploitation after police raids 
OL,6,FSix men and a teenage boy have been    
OL,7,Fcharged in connection with online child
OL,8,Fsexual exploitation after a series of  
OL,9,Fpolice raids in the west and south of  
OL,10,FScotland.                              
OL,12,FOfficers executed 18 warrants at       
OL,13,Faddresses in the Greater Glasgow,      
OL,14,FAyrshire, Renfrewshire, Dumfries and   
OL,15,FGalloway and Dunbartonshire areas as   
OL,16,Fpart of an "intensification week",     
OL,17,Fbeginning last Monday.                 
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
