OL,3,GNEWSASeven charged with online child   
OL,4,Asexual exploitation after police raids 
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy, two men aged 25, and
OL,7,Ffour other men aged 20, 45, 47 and 51  
OL,8,Fare scheduled to appear in court at a  
OL,9,Flater date. Another man, 22, was       
OL,10,Farrested and released pending further  
OL,11,Finvestigation.                         
OL,13,FPolice Scotland said "extensive        
OL,14,Finquiries" into the other 10 warrants  
OL,15,Fexecuted were ongoing.                 
